# Frontend standards

Canonical detail: `AGENTS.md`.

- Stack: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind + Radix primitives under `web/`. Match existing layout (`components/`, `pages/`, `lib/`).
- Built into the Python container as static assets (`Dockerfile` multi-stage). Strict CSP — no CDN script/style hosts.
- Do not invent latency or cost numbers in the UI; display server-provided `metrics` only.
- Citations and licence notices come from the API — do not strip attribution or Class C link-outs.
- Before finishing: from `web/`, `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` (matches `python.yml`).
- Do not add a separate frontend CI workflow; keep using the existing Python workflow job.
